# Commit-identity normalization for `git log` / `git shortlog`.
#
# One identity per contributor. The ralph loop wrote most of this repository and
# did so under several spellings of the same bot; they collapse here so the
# history reads as three authors instead of twelve. This changes display only —
# it does not rewrite any commit, so a BUILD_ID quoted by an installed image
# still resolves to a real commit here (see SECURITY.md).

